<title>ESTONIA: TARTU CITY'S CP ISSUE OVERSUBSCRIBED 2-TIMES.</title>
<headline>TARTU CITY'S CP ISSUE OVERSUBSCRIBED 2-TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tartu city's new 23 million kroon commercial paper issue was over subscribed two times, Hoiupank said on Tuesday</p>
<p>&quot;There was strong interest in the issue and it was over subscribed two times,&quot; Hassar Kipp of Hoiupank said to Reuters.</p>
<p>The commercial papers will be used to refinance the previous issue and has a yield of 8.2 percent</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
